# Mode3Controller ControlBallDrained: back to mode 2 at once, timer stopped (saved_quest -1).
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
190 poke info_text_box message_field 3
190 poke mode_timer message_field 1
200 event info_text_box ControlMissionComplete
300 event info_text_box ControlBallDrained
305 expect mode == 2
305 expect saved_quest == -1
1300 expect mode == 2
1310 quit
